<a2ui>
root=Column([a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r],"md")
a=Text("Operating hours","sg1")
b=Text("Weekdays/Saturdays: Most sources show service starting around 5:0:0 AM and ending around 11:05 PM on the Purple and Green lines; the Yellow Line runs later in evening from RV to 11:555 PM from that station.[6]","body")
c=Text("Sundays: Trains generally start at 7:00 AM","h3")
d=Text("Ticket and pass options","h1")
e=Text("Single-journey tokens are available for one trip.[13]","i")
f=Text("Smart cards are available for repeated travel and usually give a fare discount versus tokens.","q")
g=Text("QR-code / digital tickets are also accepted.","s")
h=Text("Tourist passes listed in current fare guides include 1-day,3-day,and 5-day options.","u")
i=Text("Interchange stations","h1")
j=Text("The main interchange is Nadabhu Kempegowda Station, Majestic, where the Purple Line and Green Line meet.[8]","i")
k=Text("RV Road is the key interchange between the Green Line and Yellow Line.","j")
l=Text("Other important interchange points include Jayadeva Hospital, Central Board, Krishnarajapura, MG Road, Mysuru Road, J.P. Nagar, and Jayaaya Prakash Nagara.[23]","k")
m=Text("First-time rider quick guide","h1")
n=Text("Buy a token for one trip or a smart card if you will make multiple rides.","j")
o=Text("Check your route for the correct interchange station before boarding.","k")
p=Text("Expect the network to be busiest during weekday morning and evening peak hours.[4]","l")
q=Text("If you are changing lines, Majestic and RV Road are the simplest transfer points to remember.","m")
